  "result": "Perfect! All 243 tests pass. I've successfully implemented the credit notes system:\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **src/errors.js** \u2014 Added CREDIT_TOO_HIGH error code\n\n2. **src/credits.js** \u2014 New module with:\n   - `createCreditNote(invoice, { amount, reason, date }, existingNumbers)` function that:\n     - Validates invoice is issued, partially_paid, or paid (returns NOT_ISSUED for draft)\n     - Validates amount is positive integer (returns AMOUNT_INVALID)\n     - Validates date format (returns DATE_INVALID)\n     - Validates amount \u2264 invoice total (returns CREDIT_TOO_HIGH)\n     - Generates CN-YYYY-NNNN format credit note numbers\n     - Returns { number, invoiceNumber, customerId, amount, reason, date }\n   \n   - `nextCreditNoteNumber()` helper function that:\n     - Generates credit note numbers with CN prefix (separate from invoices)\n     - Maintains independent counter per year\n     - Handles mixed invoice + credit note numbers correctly\n\n**Tests added** (19 new tests):\n- Credit note creation for issued, partially_paid, and paid invoices\n- Error handling: NOT_ISSUED (draft), AMOUNT_INVALID (zero/negative/non-integer), DATE_INVALID, CREDIT_TOO_HIGH\n- Full credit equals invoice total\n- Minimal credit (1 cent)\n- Sequential numbering within year\n- Separate counter from invoices (CN-YYYY-NNNN independent of INV-YYYY-NNNN)\n- Counter reset yearly\n- Mixed existing numbers (both invoice and credit note)\n- Large numbers (10000+)\n- Credit notes on discounted invoices\n- Credit notes on voucher invoices\n- Reason field preservation\n\nAll 243 tests pass.",
